    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can use your Channel Divinity to banish darkness and heal injured allies. As an action, you dispel any magical darkness in a 30-foot cone in front of you and evoke healing energy that can restore a number of hit points equal to five times your paladin level to creatures. Choose any creature within the cone, and divide those hit points among them. You can't use this feature on an undead or a construct.</p>",
